    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529-a5">

                <pb facs="0958" n="898" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg898"/>

                <head>Mr. Hovey to Señor Puento.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Lima,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 20, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The undersigned, envoy extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary of the United
                    States of America to the republic of Peru, has the honor to request that your
                    excellency will appoint a time and place at which he may present his original
                    letter of credence, in person, to his excellency the President of the republic
                    of Peru.</p>
                <p>An official copy of said letter of credence is herewith inclosed.</p>
                <p>The undersigned has the honor to offer to your excellency the assurances of his
                    most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ALVIN P. HOVEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Dr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">José Manuel La Puento,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Minister of Foreign Affairs.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
